    Bug 844475 - Synchronize the style and position of some of the buttons on the multimessage view. r=arschmitz

    - Implement the "Star" button in the multimessage view.
    - Synchronize the style (text+icon, only text, only icon) of the multimessage view buttons based on the header customization.
    - Fixes a missing style.

    **How to test**

    - Access a single message and click on the "More" (kebab icon) button > Customize.
    - Change the icon style and cucle through the 3 options.
    - For every option, close the customize popup and select a threaded message (or multiple message).
    - Ensure that the style fo the buttons respects the choosen customization.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D304299

